  "bodyHash": "jiG71LM2DoQ=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vg7xUZU.png\" width=\"472\" height=\"156\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-Only-d9aa6b?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=condaforge&amp;logoColor=d9aa6b&amp;labelColor=26303d\" alt=\"\" width=\"140\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Requires-Upgraded Netherite-F16436?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;labelColor=1C1C1C\" width=\"280\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:70886\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.16.x-Maintenance-yellow?style=plastic\" alt=\"\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:73242\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.17.x-Unsupported-red?style=plastic\" alt=\"\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:73250\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.18.x-Maintenance-yellow?style=plastic\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:73407\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.19.x-Active Development-green?style=plastic\" width=\"166\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Пожалуйста, используйте загрузку с CurseForge и не размещайте файлы повторно.</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Этот мод можно использовать в любых модпаках. (На CurseForge)</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">На данный момент плана для версии Fabric нет, извините.</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">Для тех, кто спрашивал о Paxels ➜</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgraded Tools</a></span></strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">Дополнение к Spartan Weaponry ➜</span><span style=\"color:#36f\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgraded Netherite : Spartan Weaponry</a></span></strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">Альтернативные текстуры доступны ➜</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/upgraded-netherite-alternative\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgraded Netherite : Alternative</a></span></strong><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;(Обновлено !)</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>ОПИСАНИЕ</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Добавляет броню из ультимерита, конскую броню, оружие и инструменты.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>КРАФТ</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/650/ultimeriteingot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/651/output_qajrzi.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"61\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1.19 :</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/652/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></span></strong>&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/653/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></span></strong></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">ЭФФЕКТЫ</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Ультимерит</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>Броня и конская броня</strong></em>: эффект от других видов брони. (Настраиваемый)</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>Оружие и инструменты</strong></em>: эффект от других видов оружия и инструментов. (Настраиваемый)</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Вы можете отключать/включать эффекты других видов брони, оружия и инструментов, комбинируя их с компонентами на верстаке.</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>Золотой слиток</em></strong> для эффекта <strong><em>Голдерита</em></strong>.</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>Палочка Блэйза</em></strong> для эффекта <strong><em>Блейзерита</em></strong>.</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>Эндер-жемчужина</em></strong> для эффекта <strong><em>Эндерита</em></strong>.</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>Кристаллы Примарина</em></strong> для эффекта <strong><em>Примарита</em></strong>.</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>Череп скелета Везера</em></strong> для эффекта <strong><em>Везерита</em></strong>.</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>Глаз паука</em></strong> для эффекта <strong><em>Спайдерита</em></strong>.</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>Мембрана фантома</em></strong> для эффекта <strong><em>Фантерита</em></strong>.</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>Перо</em></strong> для эффекта <strong><em>Феатерита</em></strong>.</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>КОНФИГУРАЦИЯ</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Клиент</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><code>upgradednetherite_ultimate-client.toml</code>&nbsp;находится в&nbsp;<code>/config</code></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Сервер</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><code>upgradednetherite_ultimate-server.toml</code>&nbsp;находится в&nbsp;<code>/saves/НАЗВАНИЕ_МИРА/serverconfigs</code></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Скопировав этот файл в вашу папку&nbsp;<code>/defaultconfigs</code>, вы сможете применить эти конфигурации ко всем вновь созданным мирам.</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">На выделенных серверах этот файл находится в&nbsp;<code>/world/serverconfigs</code></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>МОИ ДРУГИЕ МОДЫ</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1.20 +</span></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/DDjo2cf.png\" width=\"262\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/jTc5hni.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/oC1EQZw.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"78\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-totems\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/W7CebyS.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/n9kZnB2.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-gear-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/utZxZ4t.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"62\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Старые</span></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VV3KsKX.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iAwAGmm.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QL8sbmz.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-creativerite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2lTS4p1.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-aetherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g7c0DLT.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>",
